    "title": "Pine Knoll Shores uses consultant during Town Planner search - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By News 12 Staff ,\n22 hours ago PINE KNOLL SHORES — The Town of Pine Knoll Shores is working with a Wilmington planning firm while it searches for a new town planner. During the transition, AnchorPoint Planning Consultants will provide planning services for the town. Officials said Ron Satterfield and Wes MacLeod have already assisted Pine Knoll Shores in recent months. Read full article\n2",
